{% comment %}
  Renders a Purelane badge.

  The prototype has five near-identical badge treatments under different class
  names: .pill (product cards), .tag (bundle tiers), .save (combo trays),
  .flag (combo corner), and .prow em / .cut (saving chips). One component with
  a style modifier instead.

  Accepts:
  - text: {String} label (required - renders nothing when blank)
  - style: {String} pill | tag | save | flag | soldout. Default 'pill'
  - class: {String} extra classes (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'purelane-badge', text: badge_text %}
  {% render 'purelane-badge', text: 'Most popular', style: 'flag' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if text != blank -%}
  {%- assign badge_style = style | default: 'pill' -%}
  <span class="pl-badge pl-badge--{{ badge_style }} {{ class }}">{{ text | escape }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
